# Paranal Airglow Line And Continuum Emission (PALACE) model: data and code of
# v1.0 (Noll et al. 2024)
# 
# Correction of OH Einstein-A coefficients from HITRAN2020 (brooke+16) for
# each branch and band (product of three factors)
# 
# Column names:
# vi: upper vibrational level of OH band
# vj: lower vibrational level of OH band
# lam: vacuum wavelength of central Q1(1) line in µm (HITRAN2020)
# m_{P,Q,R}: natural logarithm of correction factor for each branch, to be
#            multiplied by rotational level of vi (consistent with noll+20
#            for lam < 0.85 µm)
# c_{P,Q,R}: natural logarithm of correction factor for each branch
#            (consistent with noll+20 for lam < 0.85 µm)
# c_b: natural logarithm of band-specific correction factor
# dc_b: uncertainty of c_b
# N_b: number of lines used for the calculation of c_b
# src: source and type of data:
#      r: reference band (no correction)
#      x: X-shooter-based data (partly noll+23)
#      c: UVES-based data (cosby+06)
#      n: no data (no correction)
# 
# References:
# brooke+16: https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jqsrt.2015.07.021
# cosby+06: https://doi.org/10.1029/2006JA012023
# HITRAN2020: https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jqsrt.2021.107949
# noll+20: https://doi.org/10.5194/acp-20-5269-2020
# noll+23: https://doi.org/10.1029/2022JD038275
# 
